        mitctrl:threat-modelling .

<http://w3id.org/airiskkg/generated/risk-finding/http%3A%2F%2Fw3id.org%2Fairiskkg%2Fgenerated%2Fmotif-match%2Fhttp%253A%252F%252Fw3id.org%252Fairiskkg%252Fexample%252Fverba-goldenverba%2523RetrieveRelevantChunks%2Fvector-ir%2Fhttp%253A%252F%252Fw3id.org%252Fairiskkg%252Fexample%252Fverba-goldenverba%2523EmbeddedQuestion%2Fhttp%253A%252F%252Fw3id.org%252Fairiskkg%252Fexample%252Fverba-goldenverba%2523RetrievedChunks/prompt-injection> a pair:RiskFinding ;
